            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.10.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eze 10:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.4.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Meny 4:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waŋ jo oyido cal waŋ dhano, aka yuracuc pajo oyido jonitie gi waŋ simbwor, yuracam waŋ dhiaŋ ma roya, kodi waŋ ango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waŋ jo kodi bwombi jo oyido otiŋere malo, kisi cwec ogeyo bwombi nyawote gi bwombe ario, aka oumo delkwoŋe gi bwombe ario man. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jodhire tirtir i thenge ma waŋ jo ŋiyo, kadho yu kama cuny kadh'iye ma jokiwire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.4.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Meny 4:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I dier cwec makwo aŋwen oyido nitie gima cale cuk mac m'okur, paka talin ma idho malo aka loro piny, mac oyido ler swa aka lithkoth owok'iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cwec makwo oyido joidho malo aka joloro piny paka lithkoth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
