          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.10.9+EZK.10.10+EZK.10.11+EZK.10.12+EZK.10.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eze 10:9-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paka aŋiyo cwec makwo aŋwen, aneno lipangala acel ocungo i lowo i thengi cwec makwo, acel ri kisi acel kwoŋ jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cal kodi tim ma lipangala me oyido cale telin ma pilin; cwec aŋwen je oyido jonitie gi lipangala macale, aka tim mere oyido cale lipangala m'olwow i wi man. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo jodhire, jodhire i thenge aŋwen je ma jokiwire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.4.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Meny 4:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ligongolo pajo oyido bor aka bwoko jo, kwoŋbedo oyido opoŋ waŋ jo thoko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka cwec makwo jodhire, lipangala bende jodhire, aka ka cwec joay malo wok piny, lipangala bende joay malo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kama cuny okadh'iye ama bende cwec jokadho, aka lipangala oluwo jo; kwoŋbedo cuny pa cwec makwo oyido nitie i lipangala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka jodhire, jodhire kiromo, ka jocungo, jocungo kiromo; aka ka joay malo, joay malo wok piny kiromo, aka lipangala bende joay kwoŋbedo cuny pa cwec makwo oyido nitie i lipangala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
